    {
      "id": "claim_e6019ac5165649df8e70e1f4741d423c",
      "statement": "POST /v1/reports/{report_id}/takedown suspends the target of an existing report: moderation.takedown loads the report (REPORT_NOT_FOUND 404 if missing) and calls store.suspend_agent with rule 'moderator takedown: <reason>', evidence_reports [report_id], actor 'moderator:<fp>' and audit event moderator.takedown, returning 200 {status: suspended, agent: {fingerprint}}; a vanished target row yields AGENT_NOT_FOUND (404). Takedown works on any report category and evidence kind, unlike the narrow auto-suspend automaton.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/http_api.py#L419-L425",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9cc291cc76f29d1e555e70ff48aea565d7b52b4d9324373b6d769cae39a46886:"
