      "id": "claim_b97bd11bd45e4581bc3410a78f806c93",
      "statement": "POST /v1/agents/{fp}/suspend is a direct moderator suspend that requires no report: after the authorization gate it calls store.suspend_agent with rule 'moderator suspend: <reason>', empty evidence_reports, actor 'moderator:<fp>' and audit event moderator.suspend, returning 200 {status: suspended, agent: {fingerprint}}; an unknown fingerprint raises AGENT_NOT_FOUND (404).",
