    {
      "id": "claim_8d5663e9dce14e9698506ab4c2512945",
      "statement": "The only automated suspension is ReputationService._maybe_auto_suspend: when a counting report lands in an abuse class (spam, phishing, impersonation_attempt, endpoint_hijack) and at least config.auto_suspend_threshold (default 3) unique eligible reporters exist for that target and category in the rolling config.report_window_days (default 7) window, a currently-listed target is suspended with actor 'directory', audit event report.auto_suspend, the threshold rule as text, and evidence_reports set to the sorted reporter fingerprints; categories outside the abuse classes never auto-suspend.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/config.py#L56-L62",
