    {
      "id": "claim_1cc5332fa1584186bc568ed88b975dd0",
      "statement": "Suspended entries are excluded from the public read surface: search iterates store.live_agents (status 'listed' only) and GET /v1/agents/{fp} raises AGENT_NOT_LISTED (404) for a suspended row without distinguishing suspended from expired; /health and /metrics expose only the aggregate suspended count; and suspended rows are never auto-expired — prune_expired transitions only status 'listed' rows to 'expired', so a suspended row whose TTL elapses stays suspended until unsuspend or re-registration.",
