      "statement": "DirectoryService.build_trust_block carries status and suspension (parsed suspension_json: rule, evidence_reports, at) as wire fields of the §5.2 trust block, so a suspended row's record is part of the defined trust shape even though the implemented HTTP surface only serves trust blocks for listed agents.",
