    {
      "id": "claim_4cf8ef5d0cd04a24b4a20556c8543358",
      "statement": "Every moderator action and every auto-suspend is L5-audited with actor 'moderator:<fp>' or 'directory' — the only human judgement calls in the hot path — via events moderator.takedown, moderator.suspend, moderator.unsuspend, report.auto_suspend and appeal.submitted; the chain stores only the sha256 detail_hash of the detail object (the suspension record for suspensions), so evidence bodies and reason text never enter the public chain, which instead makes attributable the actor, event, subject fingerprint, timestamp and hashes.",
